{"info": {"address1": "Plot No. 3/G-3, SIPCOT IT Park", "address2": "Siruseri", "city": "Chennai", "zip": "600130", "country": "India", "phone": "91 44 6700 8000", "fax": "91 44 6700 8874", "website": "https://www.intellectdesign.com", "industry": "Software - Application", "industryKey": "software-application", "industryDisp": "Software - Application", "sector": "Technology", "sectorKey": "technology", "sectorDisp": "Technology", "longBusinessSummary": "Intellect Design Arena Limited engages in the development, marketing, and sale of integrated banking software systems in India and internationally. It is also involved in supporting the implementation of the systems; and provides help desk support services to users of intellect software systems. In addition, the company provides software development services in the areas of wholesale banking comprising corporate core, commercial lending, payments, liquidity management, investments, virtual accounts, trade and supply chain finance, receivables and collections, treasury, corporate procurement exchange, and corporate banking exchange. Further, it offers consumer banking, including core banking, lending, cards, and digital engagement; quantum; wealth management; capital markets, such as brokerage and securities; insurance, such as magic submission, risk analyst, and underwriting; bank treasury; governance risk and compliance, as well as ESG edge; and accounts payable, procurement management, and retail solutions. The company develops IntellectAI's Purple Fabric an open business impact AI platform that delivers secure, decision-grade intelligence with measurable business impact; eMACH.ai, an open finance platform which focuses on finance operations; iTurmeric, an integration and configuration platform; and Academic TeamSpace, an AI collaboration platform for the education sector. It serves retail and corporate customers, banks, wealth managers, private bankers, card issuers, as well as capital market participants such as 